@startuml
title 2.2 Integracao incremental Top-Down com Stubs
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "ServicoPosicionamento\n<<Componente sob teste>>\n<<Servico Real>>" as servico
component "ReceptorGPSStub\n<<Stub>>" as receptorStub
component "ServicoEfemeridesStub\n<<Stub>>" as efemStub
component "CalculadoraPosicaoStub\n<<Stub>>" as calcStub
component "AplicacaoNavegacao\n<<Sistema Externo>>" as app

app --> servico : solicitarPosicao()
servico --> receptorStub : coletarObservacoes()
servico --> efemStub : obterDadosOrbitais()
servico --> calcStub : calcularPosicao()
receptorStub --> servico : observacoes controladas
efemStub --> servico : efemerides controladas
calcStub --> servico : posicao conhecida

note right of receptorStub
Substitui o receptor inferior
e evita sinais reais.
end note
@enduml
